        ;;
      ""|help|--help|-h)
        cat <<'USAGE'
usage: contract session <subcommand>

Σ6 — multi-client session presence + claim. Compose with Σ3 (aliases) +
Σ4 (agent inbox fan-out) for cross-device generative-UI routing.

  register   --canonical <id> --transport <name> --client-id <id> [--ttl 300]
             Announce this client is online for a canonical identity.
